{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791044483,"nonce":"J2QuslHbXzPoTE7e/vlTua7/O0E=","message":"Fixed in 9763a75. Not rounding: the measurer (blinc_layout's FontTextMeasurer) had its own font registry and measures only with faces already loaded, so bold fell back to its estimate (\"Card\" at 12px: 26.40 = 4 × 0.55 × 12, against 27.34 drawn) while the renderer loaded the bold face on demand. Now the measurer shares the renderer's registry (init_text_measurer_with_registry) and text::ensure_face loads a node's face at creation and whenever its font, weight or style changes. Regression test text::tests::layout_measures_text_as_drawn checks measured equals drawn for regular and bold.","files":null}]}